  threatName: Spoofed Domain
  threatDescription: A spoofed domain is a fake web or email address that closely
    imitates a legitimate one to deceive users. Attackers change small details like
    missing letters, extra symbols, or altered extensions to make the domain look
    authentic and trick people into trusting fraudulent emails or websites.
